        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Drinks were good. The food was a bit tasteless to be honest, the pasta ravioli didn’t had any flavour. The cauliflower bites were the best part. I like the vibes and the location. Food could be better.",
        "time": 1718559845,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicolitsa1",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103488197670658655324/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUKPAlHPa1FdwKZfh4eLM9-QLRYZe-iYHtMviSMzqsllr2bC4o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Me and my daughter stopped for a late lunch and enjoyed our meal very much. The host at the door was super friendly and smiley. He allowed my daughter to pick her own popcorn which she loved. We ordered the kids salmon and the cowboy sandwich. The food was very good and tasty, but i would suggest maybe slicing the steak a bit thinner to make it he sandwich a bit easier to bite through. But best of all was our waitress Clara! She was above and beyond amazing! Very welcoming and so great with her suggestions. She is by far the best server I’ve ever had in any Cage establishment. Even when she got busy she was so attentive to us and to her other tables as well. Give the woman a raise!",
        "time": 1756168503,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Bless",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110247344023880701247/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKVPcY7juqzNymBYypj7RKy3Z8Ibacwnnqg1tz5UyGQcbsr1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "It’s my go to restaurant. I’ve lived in Vaudreuil for 6 years now and I always come back to La Cage. The service is honestly exceptional, they’re very very kind and attentive, not pushy, and funny too! Food is always always very good, generous portions, and very decently priced ! Strongly recommend",
        "time": 1767843025,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
